<urn:usf:requirement:dispatch-offline-validation> <urn:usf:predicate:semanticStage> <urn:usf:stage:validation> <urn:usf:graph:dispatch-accounting> .
<urn:usf:requirement:dispatch-offline-validation> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "The declared confined test covers no route, no credentials, a contacted provider or transport refusal, a partial wave, structural output rejection, cache reuse and a successor repair. It checks counter conservation, aliases, attempt phase/contact, exact lineage, preservation of usage/cost fields and that no fixture path can contact a provider. Missing, negative, contradictory or impossible counters refuse rather than being normalized." <urn:usf:graph:dispatch-accounting> .
<urn:usf:requirement:dispatch-offline-validation> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:usf:graph:dispatch-accounting> .
