<urn:usf:requirement:transport-timeout-equivalence> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "TRANSPORT_TIMEOUT and PROVIDER_TIMEOUT retain their raw reason codes but receive the same bounded timeout-grade deferral: fifteen minutes on the first observation, exponential growth capped at two hours, success clearing unchanged. Generic invocation failures keep the existing two-minute exponential class." <urn:usf:graph:dispatch-accounting> .
